2015-07-31 11:56 GMT-03:00 Markus Neteler <neteler at osgeo.org>:

> Hi,
>
> On Fri, Jul 24, 2015 at 9:47 AM, Rainer M Krug <Rainer at krugs.de> wrote:
> > Markus Neteler <neteler at osgeo.org> writes:
